    @damage-player(2)
} Looped: true)
</code></pre> <p>For this example, we have made our <code>main-game</code> <code>Looped: true</code>. Now, let's make our player try to heal their health after it falls below a certain value. First, let's create a new definition called <code>@heal-player</code>.</p> Code So Far <pre><code>@define(heal-player {
